{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"19941","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v14141","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"置弓枷","creatorId":"vndb:s3561","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:3501","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3561","name":"置弓枷","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:130098","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"関口辰巳","creatorId":"vndb:s9965","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:13795","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s9965","name":"関口辰巳","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:130099","source":"egs"}],"music":[],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c22923","characterName":"桐嶋 玲奈","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"126552","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"103310"}],"egsCharacterIds":["2982"],"vndbCharacterId":"c22923"},"originalCharacterName":"桐嶋 玲奈","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The daughter of a wealthy businessman she's extremely prideful. She tries to use her father's wealth to protect herself from the KRB Program but can't. She tries to flee Japan but fails. With no friends or allies she's destined to live as nothing but a tool for breeding."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c22923"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"大統領・桐嶋亮三の愛娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"教養と美貌を兼ね備えていて、学園では教師すら一目おく生徒会長として君臨している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『我がまま放題』、『蝶よ花よ』と可愛がられてきたために、『自分さえ良ければいい』という高慢な性格になってしまった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その反面、世間知らずで安易なおだてにも他人を疑わず乗りやすい。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2982","sourceWorkId":"19941","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"否定KRB法的总统·桐岛亮三的爱女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"才貌双全，在学院作为教师也要让步三分的学生会会长而君临。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格任性随意，因为出生于众星捧月的环境中的缘故养成了“只要自己好就无所谓”的傲慢性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"另一面不懂世故，不会怀疑他人，就算是很拙劣的奉承也会上当。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"126552"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7d/7ddfe532b057e3551f64ea6e3fadb55c2625a78c8e90766d3d0206120bc8acad.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d2/d2a6c46af48249290790b968b885eda9e75b66dddadcbe0ae00cdf0b4c5451c8.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"水口まつり","creatorId":"vndb:s879","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s879","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s879","name":"水口 まつり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:103310:126552:6380:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c22924","characterName":"九条 朱音","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"126553","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"103310"}],"egsCharacterIds":["2984"],"vndbCharacterId":"c22924"},"originalCharacterName":"九条 朱音","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shiori's elder sister. After Shiori is put into the KRB Program she desperately searches for her. With nothing to bargain with she's forced to sell her body for information."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c22924"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"妹思いの正義感あふれる美少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"反面、病気の治療などを嫌がる妹をあまり快く思っていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"桐嶋玲奈と同じ学校に通っている女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"成績も優秀で、その美貌と優しさから誰からも好かれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しっかりとした性格である反面押しに弱く、頼まれ事などをすると容易には断れない優柔不断な面も持っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2984","sourceWorkId":"19941","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"重视妹妹的充满正义感的美少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"只是对甘愿放弃治疗的妹妹的态度感觉不满。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"和桐岛玲奈上同一个学院。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"成绩优秀，因为美貌和温柔性格而深受每个人的喜欢。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"但是在坚强的另一面缺少魄力，有着无法轻易拒绝请求的优柔寡断的一面。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"126553"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/db/dba15ad607d09cc567910c4eca23d0cc53b83f1958b75ba638c6224e2715b360.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1d/1d79ddae1517e6b5753fb04ea3d4b3fcc1e066b1ab86da53487a59161dafc54d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"西野ゆみこ","creatorId":"vndb:s934","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s934","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s934","name":"西野 ゆみこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:103310:126553:14142:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c22925","characterName":"綾瀬 沙希","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"126554","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"103310"}],"egsCharacterIds":["2983"],"vndbCharacterId":"c22925"},"originalCharacterName":"綾瀬 沙希","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Reina's maid. She desperately tries to protect her mistress from being raped but fails."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c22925"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"玲奈の世話をするためにだけ雇われている『お付』のメイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"処世術に長けていて、表向きは明るく可愛らしいが、腹に一物を持ち、時折妖しい素振りを見せる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"表面では玲奈を慕い付き従っているように見えるが、世間知らずな玲奈を持ち上げたり褒め称えたりしつつ言葉巧みに操っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2983","sourceWorkId":"19941","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"被雇佣照顾玲奈的随从女仆。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"擅长为人处世，表面上开朗可爱，但内里一肚子坏水，时不时会彰显出妖娆的举止。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"表面上仰慕玲奈而跟随其左右，但实则是一边奉承不懂世故的玲奈一边运用话语进行操纵。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"126554"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/74/74ac434ba37aee9c26c27cf61c18a4e177fa030fcec187a240ad225b800a3bb2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/09/09633ff15114f101d7e09a90162787951699d8a97fb9d36361470182b003c45d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"飯野ユウ","creatorId":"vndb:s931","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s931","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s931","name":"飯野 ユウ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:103310:126554:6377:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c22926","characterName":"九条 栞","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"126555","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"103310"}],"egsCharacterIds":["2985"],"vndbCharacterId":"c22926"},"originalCharacterName":"九条 栞","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Raped again and again and again for days and nights without end her health is failing. Fearing that only death awaits her she prays that her sister Akane can find her and rescue her from this hell."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c22926"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"九条朱音の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"先天性の心臓疾患のため病弱で、今の歳になるまでのほとんどの時間を入院という形で暮らしてきた女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分とは違い、凛としている朱音を心から慕っていて自分も姉のようになりたいと思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だがそんな反面、朱音があまりにもしっかりし過ぎていているため、朱音に対しては若干甘えん坊な一面を見せる事もある。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2985","sourceWorkId":"19941","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"九条朱音的妹妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为先天性的心脏病而身体虚弱，在这之前的时间基本上都是在医院里度过的女孩子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"发自内心地仰慕和自己不一样的凛然的朱音，自己也希望能和姐姐一样。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"但因为朱音太过可靠的缘故，对朱音有着些微的撒娇的一面。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"126555"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3d/3d86cba883ea06dc1bd84606ff4763d2ef30599790e1f129047f21dd386dc35f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ab/abe02e9a81ad64ef2a51b7e4bebaf02c40da12b5e2a0015ad2adb36a17d8d8bc.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"橘志穂","creatorId":"vndb:s738","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s738","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s738","name":"橘 志穂","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:103310:126555:7169:1","source":"bangumi"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p863","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:1465","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p863","name":"Delta","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:19941:1465","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p863","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p863","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p863","name":"Delta","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:35951:v14141","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p863","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p863","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p863","name":"Delta","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:37504:v14141","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p863","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p863","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p863","name":"Delta","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relation